# 🚀 Day 31 – AI Supply Chain Control Tower

## 📌 Challenge Overview

Day 31 focused on building **AI Supply Chain Control Tower**, an interactive operations management simulator using **Claude AI**. The application places users in the role of a **Head of Operations**, where they monitor live supply chain disruptions, prioritize critical alerts, and make strategic decisions to maximize business performance before time runs out.

This project demonstrates how AI can transform real-world supply chain operations into an engaging, educational simulation.

---

# 🏭 Project Description

**AI Supply Chain Control Tower**

A single-file HTML application that simulates a modern operations control center where users manage multiple supply chain incidents in real time while monitoring key business KPIs.

Every simulation generates random operational alerts, requiring users to respond quickly and strategically.

