# 📊 Dashboard KPIs

The simulator tracks:

- 📈 Service Level
- 😊 Customer Satisfaction
- 📦 Inventory Health
- 🚚 Transportation Efficiency
- 💰 Operating Cost
- 💵 Revenue Protected
- 🏆 Score
- ⏳ Remaining Time

All KPIs update dynamically based on user decisions.

---

# 🚨 Operational Alerts

Randomly generated scenarios include:

- Port Congestion
- Supplier Delay
- Truck Breakdown
- Warehouse Stockout
- Customs Inspection
- Demand Spike
- Factory Machine Failure
- Weather Disruption
- Wrong Inventory Count
- Damaged Shipment

Each alert includes:

- Title
- Description
- Priority Level
- Time Remaining
- Business Impact

---

# ⚙️ Decision Actions

For each alert, users can choose actions such as:

- Expedite Shipment
- Use Backup Supplier
- Reroute Trucks
- Increase Production
- Transfer Inventory
- Approve Air Freight
- Ignore
- Delay Decision

Each decision directly affects business performance and future operational risks.

