# 🎮 Gameplay Flow

### 1️⃣ Start Simulation

Become the **Head of Operations**.

---

### 2️⃣ Monitor Live Alerts

Review operational incidents and prioritize the most critical issues.

---

### 3️⃣ Make Strategic Decisions

Resolve disruptions before they escalate.

---

### 4️⃣ Watch KPIs Update

Business metrics change instantly based on each decision.

---

### 5️⃣ Manage Time

The game becomes more difficult as additional alerts appear.

---

### 6️⃣ Final Performance Report

At the end of the simulation, review:

- Final Score
- Performance Grade (A+ to D)
- KPI Summary
- Alerts Resolved
- Correct Decisions
- Wrong Decisions
- Personalized Operational Feedback

